project('three-gorges','長庫區洪水預報與航運發電耦合~Flood forecasting and navigation generation coupling in a long reservoir','以三峽大型複合工程為背景，進一步追蹤預報偏差如何耗用防洪空間、長庫區流量如何轉成不均勻水位，以及泥砂和溫度如何改變調度判斷。學員把船閘用水、機組淨水頭及電力爬坡列成可核對帳本，避免只用總裝機容量代表每個時段的可供電力。~Using Three Gorges as context, trace how forecast bias consumes flood space, how flow produces spatially varying levels, and how sediment and temperature affect decisions. Build auditable accounts of lock water, turbine net head and electrical ramping, recognizing that installed capacity cannot describe deliverable power in every interval.','業主介紹將三峽列為混凝土重力壩與航運、發電、防洪結合的工程，記錄一九九四年開始施工，二〇一二年主要機組全部投產。這些是工程背景而非本課假想洪水的校準資料。本新增單元延續原有課程，將焦點放在跨系統守恆及不確定性；一九八七年的監測手冊只是方法文獻年代，二〇二六年則標示教材覆核。蓄水高程與壩體高度分別定義，不能因數字近似便互換使用。~The owner describes a concrete gravity dam combining navigation, generation and flood management, with construction beginning in 1994 and the main generating units all operating in 2012. These milestones establish context rather than calibrate the hypothetical flood in this course. The added units extend earlier lessons through conservation across subsystems and uncertainty. The 1987 instrumentation reference dates literature, while 2026 dates curriculum review. Reservoir elevation and structural dam height retain different reference datums and cannot be interchanged.','業主公開總裝機容量為22500MW，並非每個時段保證出力~Owner published installed capacity is 22500 MW, not guaranteed output in every interval',1994,'三峽工程正式開始施工，屬業主公布建設節點~Three Gorges construction formally begins, an owner documented project milestone','中國~China',30.823,111.003,['three-gorges-owner','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b202','拱重力壩熱力水力與監測交互診斷~Arch gravity dam thermal hydraulic and monitoring diagnosis','以胡佛壩為背景，區分自重抗滑與拱向傳力、裂縫連通與揚壓，以及冷卻收縮與接縫閉合。後半部把壓力瞬變、低水頭出力、排砂與量測溫漂連結，讓學員用相互獨立的證據判斷異常原因。所有試算都明示幾何與材料是假想值，不替代既有壩評估。~Using Hoover as context, distinguish gravity resistance from arch transfer, crack connectivity from uplift, and cooling contraction from joint closure. Later units connect pressure transients, low-head output, sediment and measurement drift, requiring independent evidence to distinguish causes. Every calculation uses declared hypothetical geometry or material data and cannot replace assessment of the existing dam.','墾務局以基岩至壩頂道路量得的七百二十六點四英尺描述胡佛壩高度，並明確說明它兼具拱與重力作用。官方紀錄載混凝土於一九三三年六月開始澆置、一九三五年五月完成最後澆置；課程不把最後一盤混凝土等同所有附屬工程竣工。新增內容著重既有大壩的相互作用與證據判讀，原創算例與歷史冷卻系統的實際尺寸保持分離，文獻出版日期也另作方法研究節點。~Reclamation defines Hoover height from foundation rock to the crest roadway and describes both arch and gravity action. Its record places the first concrete in June 1933 and the last placement in May 1935; this is not treated as completion of every associated facility. The additional material concerns interactions and evidence in an existing major dam. Original examples remain separate from historical cooling system dimensions, and publication dates identify methodological references rather than construction events.','官方壩高726.4ft以基岩至壩頂道路為量測基準~Official dam height 726.4 ft uses foundation rock to crest roadway as its datum',1933,'六月開始壩體混凝土澆置，不代表全部工程同年完成~Dam concrete placement begins in June, not completion of the entire development','美國~United States',36.016,-114.738,['hoover-owner','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments','usace-catalog'])
project('b203','水電灌溉抽水與大型機組更新介面~Hydropower irrigation pumping and major unit renewal interfaces','大古力案例將發電與灌溉抽水放入同一能量和水量帳，並追蹤前池水位、管路阻力與機組停機如何相互影響。課程接續混凝土分塊、基礎排水與量測基準，再以灌溉回歸流及更新後效率驗證收束；學員須解釋不同時間尺度的資料為何不能直接相減。~The Grand Coulee case places generation and irrigation pumping in one water and energy account and follows interactions among forebay level, pipe resistance and outages. Concrete blocks, foundation drainage and survey reference control lead into irrigation return flows and post-renewal efficiency verification. Learners explain why observations from different time scales cannot simply be subtracted.','墾務局施工史記載大古力工程於一九三三年開始，第一批混凝土在一九三五年澆置，灌溉抽水設施於一九五一年完成。這些分期事件提醒學員：攔河壩、發電與灌溉系統不是同一天形成的單一設備。本課以此分期背景研究接口責任與守恆，並不聲稱假想流量等於現場抽水量。監測手冊出版年代另列為知識背景，二〇二六年的來源核對也與歷史建設明確區分。~Reclamation construction history places the start of Grand Coulee in 1933, the first concrete in 1935 and completion of the irrigation pumping plant in 1951. These stages show that the dam, generation and irrigation systems did not arrive as one device on one date. The course uses that sequence to examine interfaces and conservation, without identifying assumed flows as field pumping records. Instrumentation publication dates describe reference history, and the 2026 source check is distinguished from construction.','灌溉抽水設施於1951年完成，屬官方分期建設紀錄~The irrigation pumping plant was completed in 1951, an official staged construction record',1933,'大古力工程開始施工，之後抽水及發電設施分期擴展~Grand Coulee construction begins, followed by staged pumping and generating development','美國~United States',47.956,-118.982,['coulee-owner','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments','usace-catalog'])
