source('xiluodu-voith','溪洛渡發電機供應商技術介紹~Xiluodu generator supplier technical account','Voith','https://www.voith.com/corp-en/industry-solutions/hydropower/large-hydro/xiluodu-china.html','核對二〇一四年全廠併網與視在功率單位，避免把兆伏安當兆瓦~Checks full plant connection in 2014 and apparent-power units, avoiding confusion between MVA and MW','turn165view0',['Full connection June 2014, eighteen units and 13.86 GW nominal plant capacity','Generator example rated 855.6 MVA; apparent power is not active power'])
project('b204','雙頻率水電系統與跨境能量協調~Dual frequency hydropower and cross border energy coordination','伊泰普提供同一水力系統連結不同電網頻率的案例。學員從同步轉速、換流損失及無功容量出發，再追蹤尾水耦合、洩洪動量、冷卻與振動，最後建立跨時區資料帳。課程把電力份額與水量分配分開處理，避免將制度安排誤認為固定物理分流比例。~Itaipu illustrates one hydraulic development linked to grids with different frequencies. Learners examine synchronous speed, converter loss and reactive capacity before tailwater coupling, spillway momentum, cooling, vibration and time-aligned records. Electrical allocation and water distribution are handled separately, preventing institutional arrangements from being mistaken for a fixed physical flow split.','業主歷史記載伊泰普首部機組於一九八四年五月五日開始發電，最後兩部機組於二〇〇七年五月投入運轉。官方頻率說明指出二十部機組分成五十與六十赫茲兩組；此資料用於說明跨電網介面，不暗示兩種交流母線可以直接並聯。本課不沿用網頁中的歷史世界排名，也不把電力容量與年發電量混寫；假想的換流效率與尾水參數都另外標明，文獻年代則屬方法背景。~The owner history records first generation on 5 May 1984 and entry of the last two units in May 2007. Its frequency explanation divides twenty units between fifty and sixty hertz groups, establishing a grid-interface context rather than permission to parallel unlike AC buses. Historical world rankings are not repeated, nor is installed power confused with annual energy. Assumed converter efficiencies and tailwater parameters are identified separately, while reference publication dates describe methods rather than construction.','官方說明20部機組分成10部50Hz與10部60Hz~The official explanation divides 20 units into ten at 50 Hz and ten at 60 Hz',1984,'五月首部機組開始發電，後續機組分期加入~The first unit generates in May, with other units added in stages','巴西與巴拉圭~Brazil and Paraguay',-25.408,-54.588,['itaipu-owner','itaipu-frequency','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b205','大型法蘭西斯轉輪更新與證據鏈~Large Francis runner renewal and evidence chains','古里案例以供應商公開的機組更新紀錄為起點，研究汽蝕、效率試驗、轉矩與對心、冷卻及停機順序。課程要求每項改善主張都有對應量測與比較工況，並把轉輪最大出力、名目出力和全廠供電可靠度分開。學員以故障假說表統整水力與機械證據。~Starting from a supplier record of Guri modernization, study cavitation, efficiency testing, torque, alignment, cooling and outage sequence. Each claimed improvement requires matching measurements and comparable operating conditions. Runner maximum power, nominal output and plant supply reliability remain separate concepts, brought together through a table of hydraulic and mechanical fault hypotheses.','供應商紀錄描述古里第二發電廠五部機組更新，並記載二〇一二年安裝大型法蘭西斯轉輪。文中的七百七十兆瓦是轉輪相關最大功率尺度，不能當作全廠裝機容量，也不能與名目功率混用。本課據此研究設備更新如何驗證，不推定未讀得的壩體施工年代或當前所有設備狀態。歷史監測手冊只是比較文獻，原創測試輸入及二〇二六年覆核日期另列，避免把教材算式寫成供應商保證。~The supplier account describes modernization of five units in Guri powerhouse No. 2 and installation of a large Francis runner in 2012. Its 770 MW figure concerns maximum runner-related power, not total plant capacity or nominal output. The course uses this evidence to examine verification of renewal without inferring unread dam-construction dates or present condition of every unit. Instrumentation literature supplies bibliographic context; original test inputs and the 2026 review date are separate from any supplier performance guarantee.','供應商記載2012年安裝770MW尺度的法蘭西斯轉輪~The supplier records installation of a 770 MW class Francis runner in 2012',2012,'供應商記錄大型轉輪安裝，屬機組更新而非整壩落成~A supplier records large-runner installation, a unit-renewal event rather than dam completion','委內瑞拉~Venezuela',7.766,-63.002,['guri-andritz','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b206','強震區高拱壩與岸坡耦合~High arch dam and abutment slopes in seismic terrain','小灣案例將高拱壩傳力與兩岸岩體變形放入同一分析脈絡，探討卸荷、地下水、溫度和地震慣性如何改變原先假設。另以季節調蓄、下游變流及密度分層連接水庫運轉，讓學員分辨結構極限、量測殘差與環境控制是不同層次的判斷。~The Xiaowan case combines high-arch load transfer with abutment deformation, examining how unloading, groundwater, temperature and seismic inertia alter assumptions. Seasonal storage, downstream flow changes and stratification connect the structure to operation. Learners distinguish structural limits, monitoring residuals and environmental controls as different levels of assessment rather than one interchangeable score.','華能公開介紹記錄小灣六部機組合計四千二百兆瓦，於二〇一〇年八月全部建成投產，並將高邊坡、卸荷與溫控列為工程難題。課程保留這些可核對的背景，但不把三百米級描述當成精確壩高。教學中的彈簧、岩楔及水量模型只分離一項機制，沒有重建業主三維分析或地震輸入。監測文獻出版與教材覆核各自標示，避免把網站文章更新日期誤認為水電站投產日。~Huaneng records six Xiaowan units totaling 4200 MW, all operating in August 2010, and identifies slopes, excavation unloading and temperature control as engineering challenges. The course retains those documented facts without interpreting a three-hundred-metre class description as an exact height. Spring, rock-wedge and water-balance examples isolate mechanisms rather than reproduce the owner three-dimensional model or earthquake inputs. Reference publication and curriculum review are dated separately from commissioning and from website article updates.','官方記錄6部機組總裝機4200MW~The official record lists six generating units totaling 4200 MW',2010,'八月全部六部機組建成投產，屬業主歷史紀錄~All six units enter operation in August, an owner documented milestone','中國~China',24.704,100.091,['xiaowan-huaneng','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b207','超高雙曲拱壩與深谷環境邊界~Very high double curvature arch dam and canyon boundaries','錦屏一級案例從拱座幾何與岩體路徑開始，逐步處理水壓合力、預應力、地震慣性、噴流水舌與熱變形。水庫端再加入季節儲存和取水溫度的守恆，強調結構、消能與生態證據不可互相替代。所有模型保留量綱並列出需要三維分析的缺項。~The Jinping I case begins with abutment geometry and rock load paths, then addresses water-force resultants, prestress, seismic inertia, spillway jets and thermal movement. Seasonal storage and withdrawal-temperature balances extend the reservoir boundary. Structural, dissipation and ecological evidence cannot substitute for one another, and every dimensional model identifies questions requiring three-dimensional analysis.','雅礱江業主介紹記錄錦屏一級為三百零五米雙曲混凝土拱壩，二〇〇五年正式開工，二〇一四年全部機組投產。課程使用這些事件建立高壩系統的時序背景，並將網站後續遷移日期排除於建設史之外。原創假想荷載與岩體參數不聲稱來自現場，亦不把單一截面自由體圖當成拱殼驗證。水庫高程、壩高與壓力水深需保有各自基準，避免在不同模型間誤換。~The Yalong River owner describes Jinping I as a 305 m double-curvature concrete arch dam, with formal construction beginning in 2005 and all units operating in 2014. These events establish system history; later website migration dates are excluded from construction chronology. Original loads and rock parameters are hypothetical, and a section free-body diagram is not treated as validation of an arch shell. Reservoir elevation, dam height and pressure depth retain distinct datums when moving between models.','業主記錄雙曲混凝土拱壩高度305m~The owner records a 305 m high double-curvature concrete arch dam',2014,'七月全部機組投產，不代表本課假想試驗曾在現地執行~All units operate in July; this does not imply the hypothetical course tests occurred onsite','中國~China',28.184,101.630,['jinping-owner','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b208','百萬千瓦機組與高拱壩多尺度~Gigawatt units and multiple scales of a high arch dam','白鶴灘案例連結柱狀節理岩體、低熱混凝土與大型水輪發電機，從局部剛度及熱量一路推到轉矩、視在功率、冷卻和調速介面。課程刻意分開實際裝機規模與假想材料參數，並要求學員對每個簡化模型提出可驗證觀察及升級分析條件。~The Baihetan case connects jointed rock, low-heat concrete and large turbine-generators, moving from local stiffness and thermal energy to torque, apparent power, cooling and governor interfaces. Actual installed scale is separated from assumed material parameters. Each simplified model requires an observable verification method and a stated condition for more advanced analysis.','三峽集團官方報導記錄白鶴灘十六部百萬千瓦機組於二〇二二年十二月全部投產。本課以此機組尺度為背景，但不把單機功率直接換成結構載重，也不沿用報導的世界排名作永久結論。教材中的岩體方向剛度、混凝土熱性質及機電效率都是原創假設，需要另行試驗才能使用於工程。歷史監測手冊僅作資料方法索引，二〇二六年的來源核對不表示工程在該年新增完工。~The official Three Gorges report records all sixteen million-kilowatt Baihetan units operating in December 2022. That scale motivates the course, but unit power is not converted directly into structural load, and contemporary world rankings are not presented as permanent facts. Directional rock stiffness, concrete thermal properties and electromechanical efficiencies are original assumptions requiring testing before engineering use. Historical instrumentation manuals provide methodological indexing, while the 2026 source check is not a new completion event.','官方記錄16部1000MW機組全部投產~The official report records all sixteen 1000 MW units commissioned',2022,'十二月二十日全部機組投產，屬官方報導的運轉節點~All units enter operation on 20 December, an officially reported operating milestone','中國~China',27.223,102.903,['baihetan-owner','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
project('b209','高拱壩與發電機額定量的辨識~High arch dam and generator rating interpretation','溪洛渡案例從發電機視在功率與實功區分開始，接續冷卻、轉速、轉矩與振動，再回到拱壩變形、水力消能及梯級調度。學員須追蹤每筆資料的量測邊界，說明同一數值在設備銘牌、瞬時測試和年度電量中具有不同意義，避免由規模推定性能。~The Xiluodu case starts by distinguishing apparent and active generator power, then studies cooling, speed, torque and vibration before returning to arch deformation, dissipation and cascade scheduling. Learners track measurement boundaries and explain why a number on a rating plate, during a test and in annual energy accounting means different things.','供應商技術介紹記錄溪洛渡於二〇一四年六月全廠併網，並列十八部機組及十三點八六吉瓦名目裝機。文中單部發電機的八百五十五點六兆伏安是視在功率，不能當成相同數字的兆瓦。課程保留此單位辨識重點，不重複未獨立核對的減碳估算或世界排名。新增算例的功率因數與水力參數均為假設，歷史文獻年代及教材覆核日期亦與工程投產事件分開。~The supplier technical account records full Xiluodu grid connection in June 2014, eighteen units and 13.86 GW nominal installed capacity. Its 855.6 MVA generator figure is apparent power and cannot be relabeled as the same number of megawatts. The course retains that unit distinction without repeating unverified emissions estimates or world rankings. Power factors and hydraulic values in the new examples are assumptions, and literature dates and curriculum review remain separate from commissioning events.','供應商記錄單部發電機額定855.6MVA為視在功率~The supplier records 855.6 MVA apparent power for a rated generator example',2014,'六月全廠併網，與單部機組較早測試節點分開~Full plant grid connection occurs in June, distinct from earlier individual-unit testing','中國~China',28.260,103.648,['xiluodu-voith','usbr-manuals','usbr-instruments'])
source('baihetan-construction','白鶴灘壩體施工業主紀錄~Baihetan dam construction owner account','China Three Gorges Corporation','https://www.ctg.com.cn/sxjt/xwzx55/zhxw23/2024081106572480557/index.html','官方搜尋摘錄核對柱狀節理玄武岩與低熱水泥技術背景，不推定試驗材料參數~Official indexed excerpt verifies columnar-jointed basalt and low-heat cement context without inferring material test parameters','turn188search0',['Columnar-jointed basalt foundation','Low-heat cement used across dam sections'])
C['b208']['keys'].insert(1,'baihetan-construction')
